      "role": "user",
      "content": "that turf war analogy makes sense. it's almost like the environment shifts from being collaborative to being a struggle for survival. so if i want to keep the yeast more dominant and prevent that 'acidic barrier' from forming, what specific changes should i make to the feeding process or the flour mix to favor the yeast over the bacteria?",
